; Models: one bar of sixteenth shakers, pushed on the offbeats | Neglects: two hands' unevenness | IO: (t) -> amplitude | Tags: loop
1.3*(0.65*@shaker(t) + 0.45*@shaker(t - 0.0625b) + 0.9*@shaker(t - 0.125b) + 0.4*@shaker(t - 0.1875b) + 0.65*@shaker(t - 0.25b) + 0.45*@shaker(t - 0.3125b) + 0.9*@shaker(t - 0.375b) + 0.4*@shaker(t - 0.4375b) + 0.65*@shaker(t - 0.5b) + 0.45*@shaker(t - 0.5625b) + 0.9*@shaker(t - 0.625b) + 0.4*@shaker(t - 0.6875b) + 0.65*@shaker(t - 0.75b) + 0.45*@shaker(t - 0.8125b) + 0.9*@shaker(t - 0.875b) + 0.4*@shaker(t - 0.9375b))
